abstract: >-
  ZhiyouFormal is the Lean 4 + Mathlib4 formal verification package accompanying Xiong Wei's
  three-volume theoretical trilogy (Continuous Ontology, Probability Cloud Evolution Theory, and
  Zhiyou Unified Theory). It contains two proof kernels: the original 5-module kernel (48
  machine-checked theorems, 4 explicit model-consistency constructions and 4 transparently declared
  external physical/analytic axioms), and the v7.0 kernel added on 2026-11-25
  (ZhiyouFormal/V7/ZhiyouFormal_v7.0.lean, 9 modules, 21 theorems, 0 sorry), verified on Lean 4.14.0
  + Mathlib v4.14.0 with no compiler diagnostics. Total: 69 machine-checked theorems, zero unproved
  placeholders.
